  "instruction": "只比较给定候选。先记录名称本身的读写/身份判断，再查看等长解释；保留不确定、并列与淘汰理由，不生成新名称，不推测方案来源。",
  "materials": [],
  "question": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"derivation\": \"from 'diff' (as in file difference) + 'ly' (a suffix denoting action or process), implying a tool that performs side-by-side comparison of subtitle versions\",\n      \"id\": \"C001\",\n      \"meaning\": \"a lightweight, offline tool for comparing and reviewing modified subtitle versions through visual difference detection\",\n      \"name\": \"Diffly\",\n      \"pronunciation\": \"dif-lee\",\n      \"risk\": \"no trademark conflicts or legal claims assessed; name is not claimed as registered or available\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"derivation\": \"from 'edit' and 'rune' (as in 'a mark or symbol of change'), implying each textual alteration is a visible, traceable change\",\n      \"id\": \"C002\",\n      \"meaning\": \"a name suggesting a system where every subtitle edit is a distinct, identifiable mark, aiding team comparison without network\",\n      \"name\": \"Editrune\",\n      \"pronunciation\": \"ed-itrune\",\n      \"risk\": \"abstract and less intuitive; possible misinterpretation as a 'rune-based' system; no known trademark conflicts in fictional context\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"derivation\": \"from 'subtitle' + 'light' (as in 'highlight' or 'visible'), suggesting clarity and visibility of changes in subtitles without network dependency\",\n      \"id\": \"C003\",\n      \"meaning\": \"a tool for highlighting and comparing subtitle edits in offline environments, emphasizing clear, visible textual differences\",\n      \"name\": \"Sublyte\",\n      \"pronunciation\": \"sub-lee-t\",\n      \"risk\": \"no trademark conflicts or legal claims assessed; name is not claimed as registered or available\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"derivation\": \"combines 'clip' (referring to video clips or segments) with 'check' (to verify or compare)\",\n      \"id\": \"C004\",\n      \"meaning\": \"a tool for verifying textual changes in subtitles during offline editing workflows\",\n      \"name\": \"ClipCheck\",\n      \"pronunciation\": \"clip-check\",\n      \"risk\": \"low; clearly indicates a local, verification-focused function without suggesting external connectivity or ownership\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"derivation\": \"short for 'subtitle difference', combining 'sub' (subtitle) and 'diff' (difference)\",\n      \"id\": \"C005\",\n      \"meaning\": \"a tool for comparing and highlighting changes between subtitle versions in offline editing\",\n      \"name\": \"SubDiff\",\n      \"pronunciation\": \"sub-diff\",\n      \"risk\": \"minimal; does not imply file upload or cloud dependency, and avoids implying legal or domain ownership\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"output_contract\": {\n    \"reviews\": [\n      {\n        \"decision\": \"keep/hold/drop\",\n        \"id\": \"原ID\",\n        \"reason\": \"具体判断依据\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"stage\": \"with_explanation\",\n  \"task\": \"比较全部条目。只使用当前给定数据，不推测来源路线、域名或Owner偏好。允许不确定，hold不等于通过。\"\n}\n",
  "stop": "只完成当前任务，不调用工具、不追加轮次；缺少依据明确为unknown。"
}
",
      "role": "user"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "reviews": [
    {
      "decision": "keep",
      "id": "C001",
      "reason": "名称'Diffly'读写清晰，发音简单（dif-lee），易于团队口头交流；其词源基于'diff'与'ly'，明确指向差异对比功能，符合离线字幕修改对照工具的使命；无误导性暗示网络依赖，且不涉及文件上传或所有权暗示；风险声明明确说明未涉及法律或域名冲突，符合虚构设定。"
    },
    {
      "decision": "hold",
      "id": "C002",
      "reason": "名称'Editrune'虽有创意，但'rune'易被误解为‘神秘符号’或‘基于符文的系统’，可能引发团队对功能的误读或认知偏差；词义抽象，与‘字幕修改’的直观需求脱节，不利于快速理解与口头沟通；虽无明确商标冲突，但整体可读性与实用性较弱，存在认知模糊风险。"
    },
    {
      "decision": "keep",
      "id": "C003",
      "reason": "名称'Sublyte'由'subtitle'与'light'组合，强调可见性与清晰度，契合‘突出文字变化’的使用场景；发音（sub-lee-t）自然流畅，易于记忆和口头传播；功能描述与名称逻辑一致，且明确无网络依赖提示，符合离线使用场景。"
    },
    {
      "decision": "keep",
      "id": "C004",
      "reason": "名称'ClipCheck'直接表达‘验证’功能，语义明确，团队可快速理解其用途；'clip'与'check'组合贴合视频剪辑流程，且‘check’体现审查动作，符合字幕修改复核需求；虽为常见词组合，但无误导性，不暗示上传或云端服务，符合离线使用前提。"
    },
    {
      "decision": "keep",
      "id": "C005",
      "reason": "名称'SubDiff'简洁直接，源自'subtitle'与'diff'，准确反映核心功能——对比差异；发音（sub-diff）简单易记，团队可快速掌握；不涉及网络或所有权暗示，且在功能表达上最贴切，是功能与命名的精准匹配。"
    }
  ]
}

